      "date": "2026-05-26T00:06:46.000Z",
      "title": "Earnings Miss: TTK Prestige Limited Missed EPS By 8.3% And Analysts Are Revising Their Forecasts",
      "body": "As you might know, TTK Prestige Limited ( NSE:TTKPRESTIG ) recently reported its yearly numbers. It was a pretty mixed...",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/in/consumer-durables/nse-ttkprestig/ttk-prestige-shares/news/earnings-miss-ttk-prestige-limited-missed-eps-by-83-and-anal",
