      "title": "TTK Prestige Limited Recommends Dividend for the Financial Year 2025-26",
      "body": "TTK Prestige Limited announced that at the board meeting held on May 22, 2026, The Board has recommended a dividend of INR 7.50 per share i.e. 750% for the financial year 2025-26 which shall be paid within 30 days from the date of AGM, subject to the approval of the shareholders at the upcoming 70th Annual General Meeting of the Company.",
